{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36214b64bd9e3dd7d31b4da59ea13b11d51b0104d0817ebb300af74cbe06bcc2", "ja": "レッスンの合間、カフェにやってきた玲音と\n詩花。765プロの話をしながら、静かに闘\n志を滾らせる。一方765プロでは『アイメ\nガ』の会議から戻ったプロデューサーが、響\nと翼に合同リハの予定を告げるのだった。", "zh": "课程间隙，玲音和诗花来到了咖啡馆。\n一边聊着765事务所的话题，一边静静燃起斗志。另一方面，在765事务所，刚从《アイメガ》会议回来的制作人向响和翼告知了联合彩排的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1000_se", "source_sha256": "eb7cca11a1d33854921d0734658375d3bffedba5e253ab6b11891d93644f7ad4", "ja": "カラン、カラン……", "zh": "叮铃、叮铃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1001_202xxx", "source_sha256": "6423197c62eb5296de195840815d7f3cb1c433e3115ffcaa119aaf30d97c0296", "ja": "へえ、ここが詩花のいってたお店か。\nうん、いいところだね！", "zh": "哦，这就是诗花说的那家店啊。\n嗯，真是个不错的地方呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1011fb4ce944f769563f70bedd484f52b874bcdb7813cde8b8436be0fbf60f62", "ja": "私も静香ちゃんに教えてもらったんです。\n映画の撮影でお世話になったんですって。", "zh": "也是静香告诉我的。听说她在电影拍摄期间受到了这家店的照顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1003_202xxx", "source_sha256": "a97a2a1993e12df70bae90d722f35d66e111eb422d2de43e58080740311a3788", "ja": "なるほど。最上は給仕役か何か？ メイド服でも\n着たのかな。……うん、よく似合いそうだ！", "zh": "原来如此。最上是负责侍奉之类的角色吗？她穿女仆装了吗？……嗯，感觉一定很适合她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "68fc51d33621bcc466bfe95f7aaad92829041422e38654a6214538674eca5e4e", "ja": "それで、どうしたんですか、お姉さま？\n私に聞きたいことがあるって、言ってましたけど……。", "zh": "那么，怎么了，姐姐？  \n您之前说有想问我的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1005_202xxx", "source_sha256": "34a8b748fbec01158cb3d88e3c21d0a58e7225e1d29fde8c82079ad837bfce79", "ja": "うん。一度、ちゃんと聞いてみたかったんだ。\n765プロの子達のこと、どう思ってるのかなって。", "zh": "嗯。我一直想好好问你一次。\n想知道你是怎么看待765艺能的孩子们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2c9b8d0c08063acfa5ea32d510dec8ef298bbd1e8387cfe40574559df17acbc4", "ja": "どう思ってる……というと？", "zh": "你说的“怎么看待”……是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1007_202xxx", "source_sha256": "ad19b8034a22b9c9df74043da09f31927883194eca9eceba5e4c9ad1050b6de4", "ja": "詩花は、劇場のみんなと仲良くしたいんだろう？\n互いに認め合いながら、競い合っていきたいって。", "zh": "诗花是想和剧场的大家友好相处吧？想一边互相认可，一边彼此竞争。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1008_202xxx", "source_sha256": "5b561f33a34386df5e1534a70b48e43891809fdf37ec8ec5efba45e76e095f87", "ja": "それは別に構わない。アタシも似たようなものだしね。\nでも、決定的にアタシと違いそうなことがひとつある。", "zh": "那倒没什么。我也差不多。\n不过，有一件事似乎和我截然不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1009_202xxx", "source_sha256": "a43bceab5e8b856a342766fbc6b0e1fedb7c31f9b8690aa44fb8134286946303", "ja": "詩花。キミはあの子たちの……\n心を折る覚悟はあるの？", "zh": "诗花。你做好让那些孩子……信念崩溃的觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c7908cec6dd9db45200245f61add394ea3894c8779801c32201d2c3013f68a23", "ja": "こ……、心って。お姉さま？", "zh": "心……？您是说内心吗，姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1011_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d9046f48c01f1e664315284391254b2ac4347c68c9402f21c205ccd287c30c27", "ja": "アタシは遠慮も容赦もしない。相手が傷ついて、\nそのまま倒れてもふり返らないよ。……詩花は、どう？", "zh": "我可不会客气，也不会手下留情。就算对手受了伤，就那样倒下，我也不会回头。……诗花，你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "efd1ffbf2dc6a81742e5d7ab5ba35e4fc01e350235787238c8861fbba6c153e9", "ja": "お姉さまがそういう人なのは……知ってます。それで\nいいと思います。だって、それが『玲音』だから。", "zh": "我知道姐姐就是这样的人……我觉得这样也很好。因为，那就是“玲音”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1014_201xxx", "source_sha256": "08127e6e599f0cbc110e18885f3799685257859327a0fe45cd1681dc8a3e80c7", "ja": "私は、そんな風には思えません。いい子ぶりたい\nわけじゃなくて……ただ、心が弱いから。", "zh": "我无法那样想。不是想装乖……只是因为我的内心很脆弱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1015_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ad5f41ee4b5e57197c13bcb3e848cd6fe435544700cb0cc6e02b27bfd9dee618", "ja": "でも……。\nそのかわり、私……。信じてるんだと思います。", "zh": "可是……不过，我……我想，我是相信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1016_202xxx", "source_sha256": "783e312c1ec872d8272f87ff69d676aa14591258f6b116092fd125935cdbfcbf", "ja": "何を？　あの子たちの心は折れないって？\n傷ついても、倒れることはない？", "zh": "什么？你是说，那些孩子不会被击垮？\n即使受伤，也不会倒下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1017_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ce618eda9fef3f7fb6280ed40260f72bb9769631f766d1d9c320b644196b9be2", "ja": "いいえ。傷ついても、心が折れて倒れてしまっても。\nきっと765プロのみなさんは、また歩き出すって。", "zh": "不。哪怕受了伤，哪怕灰心受挫、倒地不起。\n765事务所的大家，也一定会再次迈出步伐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1018_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ac787d8cf7e1dcd7339ae4ebb781a3fc6afd9406b43d6ef8e8ca350697d8d60c", "ja": "だってあそこには、劇場があって、素敵な仲間がいて。\nそれから、{$P$}さんがいますから！", "zh": "因为那里有剧场，有很棒的伙伴。还有{$P$}先生在呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1020_202xxx", "source_sha256": "9b734275f3ca10c7cdf3a033bdd0d29e5e37356a2f80949fa8b604970a5e7f88", "ja": "フフッ……アハハハハ！　さすがだね、詩花！\nうん、やっぱりキミは怖い子だ！", "zh": "呵呵……啊哈哈哈哈！不愧是诗花！\n嗯，你果然是个可怕的孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1021_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9105e9716ecaf214ec1e9d625e39115e7483ad93438e0ca7ca79481a408a8c5f", "ja": "えっ？　怖い、ですか？", "zh": "诶？我很可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1022_202xxx", "source_sha256": "8ff1412c08377aed5a8f3a23f37dab07a06f6f0001cf2f265abc237c0912da45", "ja": "怖いよ？　だって、心が折れても立ちあがって来い、\nってことでしょ？　フフッ、あの子たちも大変だ！", "zh": "很可怕哦？毕竟就是说，就算心灵受挫也要重新站起来吧？呵呵，那些孩子也真够辛苦的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1023_201xxx", "source_sha256": "12129c8164a2ee205c24a6a1d9c071d956b3bd7545757f8c4d0076e079628de4", "ja": "……ああっ！？　ち、違います、私、そんなつもりじゃ\nなくて、えっと……あれ、違わない……？", "zh": "……啊！？　不、不是的，我不是那个意思，呃……咦，好像也没错……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1024_202xxx", "source_sha256": "4cf9cb26143f42a4d4d792bff0dc79b14101f4e282022847b2f5b3984de3e81a", "ja": "大丈夫、それでいいと思うな。そう信じてる\n詩花だから、あの子たちも好きなんだろうし。", "zh": "没事的，我觉得那样就很好。\n正因为诗花是这样坚信着的，\n那些孩子才会喜欢你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1025_202xxx", "source_sha256": "ef00d3523d48c8d10c646c6027bbacd94bcf7f427ebf627603124ad8087850b6", "ja": "ついでに言うと、アタシも信じてる。\n……詩花なら、全力のアタシについて来れるって。", "zh": "顺带一提，我也相信。\n……如果是诗花，一定能跟上全力以赴的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1026_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6b263fc179ae86731e9fcdf2216afdbf8e01964ff21c00ed14e82a7eea514e7f", "ja": "お姉さま……。はいっ、ありがとうございます。\n大丈夫です。私も、絶対についていきます！", "zh": "姐姐大人……嗯，谢谢您。没关系，我也一定会跟上的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1027_202xxx", "source_sha256": "99e48d6d5b04f0c4076d313f3e1eb384a178fc55c49b368349797e01646e5145", "ja": "なんなら、抜いてくれても構わないんだけど？", "zh": "真要说的话，你超过我也没关系哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1028_201xxx", "source_sha256": "058a8030cb1a32146f76a30f4c6568bfa4a22270b2a8ad424d3d981e0e734850", "ja": "……もうっ、わかってるのに言わないでください。\nできるものならやってます。できないだけですっ！", "zh": "……真是的，明明心里明白，就不要说出来嘛。\n能做到的话我早就做了，只是办不到而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1029_202xxx", "source_sha256": "f2b0fefa8b54921727f3dcb67a885a89172d79c4e4412150d25dfd25da80998a", "ja": "そうかなぁ……まあいいか。\nうん、じゃあいつか、抜かれるのを楽しみにしてる！", "zh": "是这样吗……算了。\n嗯，那我就期待着有一天被你超越！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1030_202xxx", "source_sha256": "2ee673984da2d6052878e6c66ed430dce549aa809a84bfa24852d20f62a85dfd", "ja": "さて、我那覇と伊吹はどうしてるかな？\nどれくらい想像を超えてくるか……それとも？", "zh": "那么，我那霸和伊吹现在怎么样了呢？\n她们会超出我的想象多少呢……还是说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "36f145b8b4e0ea1cd8c3584235ca94dd854f5b6b1a165f4250b70012a5c951ad", "ja": "は……、はくしゅんっ！！", "zh": "阿……阿嚏！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "36f145b8b4e0ea1cd8c3584235ca94dd854f5b6b1a165f4250b70012a5c951ad", "ja": "は……、はくしゅんっ！！", "zh": "阿……阿嚏！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2d6e541ac309b445921c6e50927a2774aa217ca5f486ef3697545ffe0ee66ae6", "ja": "ううーっ、汗が冷えたのかな……？\n絶対レッスンのしすぎですよ、響さん～！", "zh": "呜呜～，是出汗着凉了吗……？\n绝对是练习过头了啦，响前辈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "8e71d1ec3a8afcf4c8637f82b36051ad4727d0e980fa0ee37b81ddb344fc2af2", "ja": "いや、きっと誰かが自分達のウワサをしてたんだ！\nほら今度のデュオ、ウワサになってきてるんでしょ？", "zh": "不，一定是有人在谈论我们吧！\n你看，这次的双人组合已经开始传出话题了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1036_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d1e8bb91eba9e060e9e4d5d2d9a3b0b714b6d023a7cb7c218c817ae7f79dc6b5", "ja": "そうみたいですけど……。でも響さんって、やっぱり\nすごいですよね。わたし、レッスンついていけるかな？", "zh": "好像是这样……不过，响小姐果然很厉害呢。我跟得上训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "b5b479b93c7f78eaf28a00ce36c2f4ab881dd81a58b00e606adc8669926fc267", "ja": "ダメだぞ翼！　今回の相手は、あの玲音と詩花なんだ。\nゆっくりなレッスンにしてる場合じゃないんだからね！", "zh": "不行哦，翼！这次的对手可是玲音和诗花啊。可不能还安排慢悠悠的训练了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aed46f4c0a47d927e479ab62dc289e226c7d00a66ae76a296b13a1870417dc9c", "ja": "ゆっくりじゃなくていいけど、\nもうちょっと普通にしましょうよ～！", "zh": "不用慢慢来的，不过，稍微正常一点吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1039_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ad030fa619faf8586422fb7a0a10755b11d35b0aa838d3a59263011eb1efdd19", "ja": "二人とも、お疲れさま。\nレッスン中悪いけど、ちょっといいかな？", "zh": "你们两个，辛苦了。\n抱歉在你们上课的时候打扰一下，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7686253ddb99c7944b3b88805939d2a655939ff3459acc47c5561c4a4b13bb83", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ！\nお疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n辛苦啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "bc888a5a8b8819667e5df51b835aef657bbc78d01e10991af74598c0d88e8a4f", "ja": "どうしたんだ、{$P$}？\n今日はずっとアイメガ会議って言ってなかった？", "zh": "怎么了，{$P$}？  \n你不是一直说今天要开艾梅加会议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "21487bf2e86cdc46b614c6efe5c443c7df70921c95c9847be1c4ad53a9ab97fe", "ja": "ああ、その会議が終わって、帰って来たんだ。\n二人とスケジュールを調整しようと思って。", "zh": "啊，那个会议结束后我就回来了。想着和你们两位协调一下日程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6573267859683a93be01ed3430c6fb88ba32516de9484d0e7a299182b3044c29", "ja": "今度、『アイメガ』の全体リハをすることになった。\n玲音と詩花も参加する方向らしい。", "zh": "下次要进行《爱梅嘉》的全员彩排。\n听说玲音和诗花也会参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f3c3da568cc03a0006dcc407fbd880435a9c4e49023d065a1b275ebf65b1f7a", "ja": "全体リハ……ってことは、玲音さん達の曲を\n先に聞けるってことですよね？　わーい、やった～♪", "zh": "全体彩排……也就是说，可以先听到玲音小姐她们的歌曲，对吧？　哇——太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "468b23757418f7aa0c8b6d024efd5606991e3cfa782b5889297c2728eda39d9f", "ja": "翼～、喜んでる場合じゃないぞ？\n全体リハはね、前哨戦みたいなモノなんだ。", "zh": "翼——，现在可不是高兴的时候哦？全员彩排啊，就像是前哨战一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0127_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0127_story_03_1047_013hib", "source_sha256": "fe2d1a4b34cd640fc627aea83b98d2d2944802be68ac0385246ee79ffc85ad1f", "ja": "よーし！　自分、ますます燃えてきたぞ！\nいよいよ戦いの始まりさー！", "zh": "好——！我越来越有干劲了！\n战斗终于要开始啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
